flowchart TD

    A([Start command_status])

    A --> B[Create runningText string]
    B --> C[Append Receiver IP Address]

    C --> D{{Loop i = 0 to 13}}

    D --> E[Append Depth Label]
    E --> F{Temperature < -100.0?}

    F -->|Yes| G[Append Temperature = N/A]
    F -->|No| H[Append Temperature Value]

    G --> I{More Depth Entries?}
    H --> I

    I -->|Yes| D
    I -->|No| J[Append Sender Information]

    J --> K[Add Sender Battery Voltage]
    K --> L[Add Sender Version]
    L --> M[Add Sender CPU Temperature]

    M --> N[Add Sender Watchdog Timer Status]
    N --> O{Watchdog Enabled?}

    O -->|Yes| P[Append WDT Enabled = Yes]
    O -->|No| Q[Append WDT Enabled = No]

    P --> R
    Q --> R

    R[Add Sender Sleep Timer Information]

    R --> S[Append Receiver Information]

    S --> T[Add Receiver Version]
    T --> U[Add Receiver CPU Temperature]

    U --> V[Append Water Detection Status]

    V --> W[Convert Bottom Water Status to Lowercase]
    W --> X[Append Water Bottom Status]

    X --> Y[Convert Top Water Status to Lowercase]
    Y --> Z[Append Water Top Status]

    Z --> AA[Append HTTP POST Status]

    AA --> AB[Append OLED Status]
    AB --> AC{OLED Enabled?}

    AC -->|Yes| AD[Append OLED Active = On]
    AC -->|No| AE[Append OLED Active = Off]

    AD --> AF
    AE --> AF

    AF[Append Debug Mode Status]

    AF --> AG{Debug Enabled?}

    AG -->|Yes| AH[Append Debug Mode = On]
    AG -->|No| AI[Append Debug Mode = Off]

    AH --> AJ
    AI --> AJ

    AJ[bot.sendMessage-chat_id, runningText]

    AJ --> AK([End])
